    {
      "en": "A cell with n below the floor prints \"untested\" WITH its n — never a fabricated rate. Honest coverage (many hops thin/untested on ~15y usable history) is the correct, publishable result.",
      "zh": "样本量低于下限的单元格打印“未检验”并附上其n——绝不编造发生率。诚实的覆盖率（许多跳在约15年可用历史上样本稀薄/未检验）是正确且可公开的结果。"
    },
    {
      "en": "State-adapter nodes (transmission/regime/forex snapshots have no stored history) bind to a DOCUMENTED series proxy where one faithfully reconstructs the live test, else the hop is untested. Each proxy's derivation is printed in the hop's method.",
